        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p><em>Your patron’s name opens doors for you, even in unfamiliar places. By invoking their name or network in the right context, you can expand your influence even further.</em></p><p>When you make a test to interact socially in high society, you can spend 2 focus to add an Opportunity to the result.</p><p>Additionally, when you acquire this talent, gain a cultural expertise in High Society.</p>",
